  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "In this side-scrolling shooter, players take control of a VF-1 Valkyrie and do battle with the forces of the Zentradi. The main goal is to enter the Zentradi ship and destroy its reactor core.\r\n\r\nThe players Valkyrie can change its appearance and abilities by switching between its three forms: Fighter, Gerwalk, and Battroid. The Fighter form is the fastest but lacks an automatic cannon, the Gerwalk form has an automatic cannon, but is slower than the Fighter form, and the Battroid form has an automatic cannon and can also shoot behind itself, however it is also moves slower than the other two forms. All forms come with a limited supply of homing missiles that can be used.\r\n\r\nDuring the game, players will come across power-up icons to collect. Power-ups can lend aid to the player, such as restoring lost power, restoring their missile supply, give them bonus points, and add an extra life."
    },
    {
      "langue": "fr",
      "text": "Choujikuu Yousai - Macross est un shoot'em up sur console 8 bits Nintendo. Vous évoluez dans l'espace à bord d'un vaisseau qui s'améliore selon les options que vous récupérez dans le niveau."
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "In diesem Side-Scroll-Shooter-Spiel übernehmen die Spieler die Kontrolle über eine Valkyrie VF-1 und kämpfen gegen die Kräfte des Zentradi. Das Hauptziel ist es, das Raumschiff Zentradi zu betreten und den Kern seines Reaktors zu zerstören. Valkyrie-Spieler können ihr Aussehen und ihre Fähigkeiten ändern."
    },
    {
      "langue": "es",
      "text": "En este juego de disparos de desplazamiento lateral, los jugadores toman el control de una Valkyrie VF-1 y luchan contra las fuerzas del Zentradi. El objetivo principal es entrar en la nave Zentradi y destruir el núcleo de su reactor. Los jugadores Valkyrie pueden cambiar su apariencia y habilidades."
    },
    {
      "langue": "it",
      "text": "In questo gioco sparatutto a scorrimento laterale, i giocatori prendono il controllo di una Valchiria VF-1 e combattono contro le forze degli Zentradi. L'obiettivo principale è entrare nella nave Zentradi e distruggere il suo nucleo del reattore. I giocatori di Valkyrie possono cambiare aspetto e abilità."
    },
    {
      "langue": "pt",
      "text": "Choujikuu Yousai - Macross é um jogo de tiro no console Nintendo 8-bit. Você se move pelo espaço a bordo de uma nave que melhora de acordo com as opções que você coleta no nível."
    }
  ],
